   "source": [
    "# CardioRisk Studio — prédiction de maladie cardiaque\n",
    "\n",
    "**Notebook pédagogique réorganisé** · Classification binaire à partir du dataset UCI Heart Disease.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objectif :** prédire la cible `target` : `0 = absence` et `1 = présence` de maladie (diagnostic d’origine `num > 0`). Ce notebook montre les étapes dans leur ordre logique : comprendre les données, explorer leur qualité, corriger les valeurs invalides, explorer les relations, puis préparer et évaluer des modèles.\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Important :** ce travail est pédagogique. Le dataset ancien et la validation sur un seul découpage ne permettent pas un usage médical ni une conclusion clinique."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "23c7f522",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Importer les bibliothèques"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "8619b4ec",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n",
    "from sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer\n",
    "from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n",
    "from sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\n",
    "from sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder, StandardScaler\n",
    "from sklearn.dummy import DummyClassifier\n",
    "from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n",
    "from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\n",
    "from sklearn.neighbors import KNeighborsClassifier\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import (accuracy_score, precision_score, recall_score,\n",
    "                             f1_score, roc_auc_score, confusion_matrix,\n",
    "                             classification_report, ConfusionMatrixDisplay)\n",
    "\n",
    "RANDOM_STATE = 42\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\")"
   ]
  },
  {
